+# Telemetry Sink Integration
+
+SDAR PostgreSQL remains the sole runtime authority.
+The telemetry relay reads committed transactional outbox records and changes only delivery metadata.
+It commits delivery only after receiving a durable WAL acknowledgement from the independent telemetry platform.
+Redis/BullMQ is wake-up infrastructure, not telemetry authority.
+Runtime capability summary is not a NodeCapabilityDefinition.
+OTel spans/logs are observational and do not substitute formal evidence.
